{"id":"encima","lemma":"encima","pos":"adv","rank":475,"glosses":["on top of something","above something","on oneself"],"ipa":"/enˈθima/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-encima.wav","examples":[{"text":"Déjalo encima de la mesa.","en":"Lay it on the table.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39257"},{"text":"Quítame las manos de encima.","en":"Get your hands off me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454551"},{"text":"¿Cuánto dinero lleva usted encima?","en":"How much money do you have with you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551531"},{"text":"El policía tenía una curda encima...","en":"The policeman was drunk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44552"},{"text":"Nunca le puse la mano encima.","en":"I never laid a finger on her.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642095"}]}